{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":4815926,"ns":0,"title":"Ball screw","extract":"A ball screw (or ballscrew) is a mechanical linear actuator that translates rotational motion to linear motion with little friction.  A threaded shaft provides a helical raceway for ball bearings which act as a precision screw.","description":"Low-friction linear actuator","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}